      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "He saw beautiful harbours in the distance, wealthy urban areas and maple forests that covered thousands of acres. He even managed to catch sight of an eagle flying upward over bushes. Kuang reached Toronto which lies near the border at a misty dawn.",
        "zh": "他看见远处美丽的港口，富裕的城区，以及绵延数千英亩的枫树林。他甚至还看见了一只鹰，在灌木丛上方向高处飞去。光到达了多伦多，这座城市靠近边境；到达时是一个雾蒙蒙的清晨。",
